g</a> moves the capital to Sabi</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">554</span><span class="rf-text">King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seong-of-baekje">Seong</a> is killed fighting Silla at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-gwansanseong">Gwansanseong</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">660</span><span class="rf-text">Silla and Tang take Sabi; King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uija-of-baekje">Uija</a> surrenders</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">663</span><span class="rf-text">Tang and Silla defeat Baekje loyalists and a Yamato fleet at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-baekgang">Baekgang</a></span></li></ol>
